      "proposal": {
        "id": "282",
        "description": "# [Gauntlet] - Arbitrum USDC - Risk, Incentive, and Interest Rate Curve Recommendations\n\n\n# Simple Summary \n\nGauntlet recommends the following parameter updates for the **Arbitrum USDC comet**:\n\n### Risk Recommendations\n\n| **Parameter**           | **Current Value** | **Recommended Value** |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------- | --------------------- |\n| WETH Supply Cap         | 10,000            | 40,000                |\n| WETH Liquidation Factor | 85%               | 90%                   |\n| WETH Collateral Factor  | 78%               | 83%                   |\n| WBTC Supply Cap         | 1,200             | 2,000                 |\n\n### Interest Rate Curve Recommendations\n\n| Parameter                              | Current Value | Recommended Value |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------------- |\n| Annual Borrow Interest Rate Base       | .015          | 0.0136            |\n| Annual Borrow Interest Rate Slope Low  | .0833         | 0.0626            |\n| Borrow Kink                            | 0.9           | 0.9               |\n| Annual Borrow Interest Rate Slope High | 4.3           | 4.3               |\n| Annual Supply Interest Rate Base       | 0             | 0                 |\n| Annual Supply Interest Rate Slope Low  | .075          | 0.062             |\n| Supply Kink                            | 0.9           | 0.9               |\n| Annual Supply Interest Rate Slope High | 3.6           | 3.94              |\n\n### COMP Distribution Recommendations\n\n| Parameter         | Current Value | Recommended Value |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | ----------------- |\n| Daily COMP Supply | 17            | 17                |\n| Daily COMP Borrow | 8             | 50                |\n\n\n## Motivation \nGauntlet recommends updating the risk, incentive, and interest rate curve parameters in the Arbitrum USDC comet to further incentivize growth at higher utilization. [Full proposal and forum discussion](https://www.comp.xyz/t/gauntlet-arbitrum-usdc-risk-incentive-and-interest-rate-curve-recommendations-7-12-2024/5418) \n\n\n## Specification \nThe proposal updates the parameters by using the respective methods on the Configurator. ***By approving this proposal, you agree that any services provided by Gauntlet shall be governed by the terms of service available at gauntlet.network/tos.***",
